{"id":"8c84f69fd256e6ce","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-treereadtwice.md","title":"A tree co-occurrence graph gives a read-twice factorization","display":"thm-treereadtwice — A tree co-occurrence graph gives a read-twice factorization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-treereadtwice","aliases":["27-thm-treereadtwice"],"display":"thm-treereadtwice — A tree co-occurrence graph gives a read-twice factorization","depends_on":["[[27-df-cooccurrence]]","[[27-df-readability]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§10.7.1 Corollary 10.1","source_printed_pages":"476","source_pdf_pages":"500","verification_status":"source-corollary-and-explicit-rooted-tree-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-treereadtwice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-treereadtwice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-treereadtwice — A tree co-occurrence graph gives a read-twice factorization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7f58350b3b48133a\" href=\"?note=7f58350b3b48133a\" title=\"27-df-cooccurrence\">27-df-cooccurrence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"80321c8440894526\" href=\"?note=80321c8440894526\" title=\"27-df-readability\">27-df-readability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§10.7.1 Corollary 10.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"476"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"500"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-corollary-and-explicit-rooted-tree-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)\\ne f(y))\">\\(\\exists x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)\\ne f(y))\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G(f)=(V,E)\">\\(G(f)=(V,E)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7f58350b3b48133a\" href=\"?note=7f58350b3b48133a\" title=\"27-df-cooccurrence\">27-df-cooccurrence</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{read}\">\\(\\mathrm{read}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"80321c8440894526\" href=\"?note=80321c8440894526\" title=\"27-df-readability\">27-df-readability</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in V\">\\(r\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:V\\setminus\\{r\\}\\to V\">\\(p:V\\setminus\\{r\\}\\to V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:V\\to\\{0,\\ldots,|V|-1\\}\">\\(h:V\\to\\{0,\\ldots,|V|-1\\}\\)</span>，满足\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E=\\{\\{v,p(v)\\}:v\\in V\\setminus\\{r\\}\\}\">\\(E=\\{\\{v,p(v)\\}:v\\in V\\setminus\\{r\\}\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(r)=0\">\\(h(r)=0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall v\\in V\\setminus\\{r\\}\\;(h(v)=h(p(v))+1)\">\\(\\forall v\\in V\\setminus\\{r\\}\\;(h(v)=h(p(v))+1)\\)</span>。\n这些条件给出以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 为根的树的父点及深度数据；孩子集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(v)\">\\(C(v)\\)</span> 由下式定义。空析取为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C(v)\\coloneqq\\{u\\in V\\setminus\\{r\\}:p(u)=v\\}\\quad(v\\in V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C(v)\\coloneqq\\{u\\in V\\setminus\\{r\\}:p(u)=v\\}\\quad(v\\in V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|V|=1\\Rightarrow\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)=x_r).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|V|=1\\Rightarrow\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)=x_r).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|V|\\ge2\\Rightarrow\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\n\\left(f(x)=\\bigvee_{\\substack{v\\in V\\\\C(v)\\ne\\emptyset}}\n\\left(x_v\\wedge\\bigvee_{u\\in C(v)}x_u\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|V|\\ge2\\Rightarrow\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\n\\left(f(x)=\\bigvee_{\\substack{v\\in V\\\\C(v)\\ne\\emptyset}}\n\\left(x_v\\wedge\\bigvee_{u\\in C(v)}x_u\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{read}(f)\\le2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{read}(f)\\le2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Corollary 10.1，印刷 p.476／PDF p.500。本地补显式证明：树无三点团，非平凡连通图中不可能有单文字素项，否则该变量不与别人共现。因此每条图边恰是一项二元素项，f为边析取。按父点把边分组成星形，上式每个变量至多作为父点一次、作为孩子一次，得到read-twice。单顶点情形独立处理。没有把此初等树证明扩张成未核验的一般partial k-tree复杂度结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-cooccurrence","status":"resolved","id":"7f58350b3b48133a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-cooccurrence]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-readability","status":"resolved","id":"80321c8440894526","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-readability]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-cooccurrence","status":"resolved","id":"7f58350b3b48133a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$ 且 $\\exists x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)\\ne f(y))$；$G(f)=(V,E)$ 见 [[27-df-cooccurrence]]，$\\mathrm{read}$ 见 [[27-df-readability]]。$r\\in V$，$p:V\\setminus\\{r\\}\\to V$，$h:V\\to\\{0,\\ldots,|V|-1\\}$，满足\n$E=\\{\\{v,p(v)\\}:v\\in V\\setminus\\{r\\}\\}$、$h(r)=0$、$\\forall v\\in V\\setminus\\{r\\}\\;(h(v)=h(p(v))+1)$。\n这些条件给出以 $r$ 为根的树的父点及深度数据；孩子集 $C(v)$ 由下式定义。空析取为 $0$。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-readability","status":"resolved","id":"80321c8440894526","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$ 且 $\\exists x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)\\ne f(y))$；$G(f)=(V,E)$ 见 [[27-df-cooccurrence]]，$\\mathrm{read}$ 见 [[27-df-readability]]。$r\\in V$，$p:V\\setminus\\{r\\}\\to V$，$h:V\\to\\{0,\\ldots,|V|-1\\}$，满足\n$E=\\{\\{v,p(v)\\}:v\\in V\\setminus\\{r\\}\\}$、$h(r)=0$、$\\forall v\\in V\\setminus\\{r\\}\\;(h(v)=h(p(v))+1)$。\n这些条件给出以 $r$ 为根的树的父点及深度数据；孩子集 $C(v)$ 由下式定义。空析取为 $0$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)\\ne f(y))","display":false},{"tex":"G(f)=(V,E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{read}","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"p:V\\setminus\\{r\\}\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"h:V\\to\\{0,\\ldots,|V|-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"E=\\{\\{v,p(v)\\}:v\\in V\\setminus\\{r\\}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"h(r)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall v\\in V\\setminus\\{r\\}\\;(h(v)=h(p(v))+1)","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"C(v)","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"C(v)\\coloneqq\\{u\\in V\\setminus\\{r\\}:p(u)=v\\}\\quad(v\\in V).","display":true},{"tex":"|V|=1\\Rightarrow\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)=x_r).","display":true},{"tex":"|V|\\ge2\\Rightarrow\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\n\\left(f(x)=\\bigvee_{\\substack{v\\in V\\\\C(v)\\ne\\emptyset}}\n\\left(x_v\\wedge\\bigvee_{u\\in C(v)}x_u\\right)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{read}(f)\\le2.","display":true}],"bytes":2088,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-104","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-treereadtwice|thm-treereadtwice — A tree co-occurrence graph gives a read-twice factorization]]"}],"outgoing":["7f58350b3b48133a","80321c8440894526"]}